5. Verification and Troubleshooting
•	For Caesar with shift 3, `HELLO` becomes `KHOOR`; decryption returns `HELLO`.
•	Rail Fence here means the two-rail even/odd method shown in the source, not the general zigzag version with an arbitrary rail count.
•	If the decrypted result differs, check that the complete code was copied and that the correct file was run.
